:PATH
Section 3 Commencement
|

:INFO
Art. 69
1 This Ordinance, with the exception of Articles 60–64 and 67 letter f, comes into force on 1 January 1993.
2 Articles 60–64 and 67 letter f come into force on 1 January 1994.
|

:INFO
Art. 70 Transitional provision
The cantons shall submit the risk maps and overall plans in accordance with Article 16 paragraph 2 letters e and f to the FOEN for the first time by 1 December 2031.
|

:NOTE
Art. 70 — Inserted by Annex No 4 of the Hydraulic Engineering Ordinance of 25 June 2025, in force since 1 Aug. 2025 (AS 2025 450).

